==Strategy==
If one has access to [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross Cat]], this stage can become immensely easier. Stacking them and Crazed Gross Cat behind a wall of meatshields can easily hold the line against the Metal Hippoes and Owlbrows. Sending out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] can also help this stage. Being this far into the game, one should have at least moderately powerful units, hopefully enough so to make this stage manageable. It is also possible to rush this stage before the Metal One Horn spawns, especially if one has [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]].

